  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ebo Sacco Limited- Technical Assistance Grant for Household and MSMEs WASH loans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ebo Sacco ltd is seeking a TA grant amounting to &#xa0;&#x20ac; 30,000 &#xa0;to facilitate the following:
Training of branch WASH champions, Credit team, and select senior management on WASH Lending in the Micro Credit space by a WASH expert.
Ebo Sacco Ltd WASH product review and re-design to meet the client&apos;s needs
Undertake marketing and promotion of the WASH loan product through activations and online advertisements
Support Ebo Sacco Ltd to attend stakeholder engagement meetings within Uganda and promote the WASH loan brand partnership with Aqua For All/OikoCredit</narrative>
  </description>
